supabase/.branches/
data/external/

# ── CV decision-vision ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Track the SOURCE (poc/, tests/poc/) and the FINDINGS. Never the pixels or
# the weights: `data/cv_decision_poc/` is ~117MB, of which ~86MB is trained
# model artifacts and ~27MB is audit frames that `poc/decision_vision/
# audit_frames.py` regenerates from a match id + window. What deserves history
# is the conclusion (vision_audit.md, report.json, progress.json) and the
# sampled timelines the audit cites, not the images it looked at.
data/cv_decision_poc/**
!data/cv_decision_poc/**/
!data/cv_decision_poc/**/*.md
!data/cv_decision_poc/**/report.json
!data/cv_decision_poc/**/progress.json
!data/cv_decision_poc/**/*.csv
# …but never these, regardless of extension:
data/cv_decision_poc/model/**
data/cv_decision_poc/model_probe/**
